msgid "call_graph_panel::Refresh"
msgstr "保留根節點，重新查詢所有顯示的內容。"

#. Opens the call graph panel with the callees of the function under the cursor.
msgctxt "action documentation"
msgid "call_graph_panel::ShowCallees"
