#. Toggles the outline panel.
msgctxt "action documentation"
msgid "outline_panel::Toggle"
msgstr "切換大綱面板。"

#. Toggles the pin status of the active editor.
msgctxt "action documentation"
msgid "outline_panel::ToggleActiveEditorPin"
