#. [`FocusNextPart`].
msgctxt "action documentation"
msgid "workspace::FocusPreviousPart"
msgstr "將焦點移至視窗中的上一個主要區域。參閱\n[`FocusNextPart`]。"

#. Follows the next collaborator in the session.
msgctxt "action documentation"
msgid "workspace::FollowNextCollaborator"
msgstr "跟隨工作階段中的下一位協作者。"

#. Formats and saves the current file, regardless of the format_on_save setting.
